    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30928" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nĭgellus</span></b> , a,
		um, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>adj.
				dim.</i> [1. niger], <i>somewhat black, dark</i>
			(ante-class.): oculi suppaetuli nigellis pupulis, Varr. ap.
					<i><span class="en">Non. 456, 8</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">amiculum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 550, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. 3, 25, 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cadmi nigellae filiae,</span>”
				i. e. <i>the letters of the alphabet</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Aus. Ep. 4, 74</span></i>
			.</div>
